  },
  "author": "invalid@example.com (Yoshi)",
  "category": {
   "domain": "https://forums.playdeadlock.com/forums/changelog.10/",
   "text": "Changelog"
  },
  "dc_creator": "Yoshi",
  "content_encoded": "<div class=\"bbWrapper\">- Added hero banning to Standard Mode and Street Brawl. You can now select one hero in your roster screen (using middle click) to tell the matchmaker that you prefer to avoid that hero. When the game starts, it will tell you which heroes were banned. We are doing just 2 total bans for now. This does not affect new heroes in the initial release window.<br />\n<br />\n- Parties of 3+ players now need to have an additional hero in their roster (from 3 to 4)<br />\n<br />\n- Fire Rate increases and reductions from most...<br />\n<br />\n<a href=\"https://forums.playdeadlock.com/threads/01-30-2026-update.102822/\" class=\"link link--internal\">Read more</a></div>",
  "slash_comments": "5"
 },
 {
  "title": "12-29-2025 Update",
