  "dc_creator": "Yoshi",
  "content_encoded": "<div class=\"bbWrapper\">- Bebop: Stamina increased from 2 to 3<br />\n- Bebop: Stamina regeneration cooldown increased from 4.55s to 6s<br />\n- Bebop: Bebop Health per boon increased from +46 to +52<br />\n- Bebop: Sticky Bomb base damage reduced from 100 to 75<br />\n- Bebop: Sticky Bomb T2 damage reduced from 63 to 60<br />\n- Bebop: Sticky Bomb Spirit Scaling increased from 1.1 to 1.5<br />\n- Bebop: Sticky Bomb per hero hit from 1.5% to 1% + 0.0025% Spirit Scaling<br />\n- Bebop: Sticky Bomb per hero kill from 4% to 2.5% + 0.015% Spirit Scaling<br />\n- Grey Talon...<br />\n<br />\n<a href=\"https://forums.playdeadlock.com/threads/12-29-2025-update.95233/\" class=\"link link--internal\">Read more</a></div>",
  "slash_comments": "3"
 },
 {
  "title": "12-16-2025 Update",
  "pub_date": "2025-12-17T20:33:46Z",
  "link": "https://forums.playdeadlock.com/threads/12-16-2025-update.93983/",
  "guid": {
