  },
  "dc_creator": "Yoshi",
  "content_encoded": "<div class=\"bbWrapper\">- The 10% move speed slow from taking damage is now a 20% slow only for the portion over the hero&#039;s base move speed<br />\n- Move Speed bonuses now stack diminishingly<br />\n- Base move speed reduced by 0.1 (except for heroes lower than 6.5)<br />\n- Heroes with move speed spirit scaling have the values reduced by 40%<br />\n- Updated move speed values on items:<br />\n<div style=\"margin-left: 20px\">- Active Reload: Move speed reduced from 1 to 0.75&#8203;</div><div style=\"margin-left: 20px\">- Backstabber: Move speed reduced from 1.75 to 1.5&#8203;</div><div style=\"margin-left: 20px\">- Fleetfoot: Move speed reduced from 3.5...&#8203;</div><br />\n<a href=\"https://forums.playdeadlock.com/threads/12-16-2025-update.93983/\" class=\"link link--internal\">Read more</a></div>",
  "slash_comments": "1"
 },
 {
  "title": "11-21-2025 Update",
  "pub_date": "2025-12-04T00:34:27Z",
  "link": "https://forums.playdeadlock.com/threads/11-21-2025-update.90383/",
  "guid": {
   "is_perma_link": false,
   "text": "urn:xenforo:thread:90383"
  },
  "author": "invalid@example.com (Yoshi)",
  "category": {
   "domain": "https://forums.playdeadlock.com/forums/changelog.10/",
   "text": "Changelog"
  },
  "dc_creator": "Yoshi",
  "content_encoded": "<div class=\"bbWrapper\"><b>[ General ]</b><br />\n<br />\n- Trooper bounty mechanics have been reworked. The first half of the souls still fly out as deniable orb, however rather than the other half being instantly given to nearby players it will fall to the ground as an orb that you need to get near to pick up. It has a 18m capture radius where it&#039;ll travel to you once you get within. Only one player needs to claim it, share rules remain the same as before.<br />\n- They last for 18s on the ground. Duration increases by 2s per minute...<br />\n<br />\n<a href=\"https://forums.playdeadlock.com/threads/11-21-2025-update.90383/\" class=\"link link--internal\">Read more</a></div>",
  "slash_comments": "5"
 },
 {
  "title": "10-24-2025 Update",
  "pub_date": "2025-10-24T23:54:51Z",
  "link": "https://forums.playdeadlock.com/threads/10-24-2025-update.87198/",
  "guid": {
